to formal music lessons, so I found my voice through school choirs, church, worship ministry, drag performance and every stage that would have me. After family violence, abusive relationships, addiction, PTSD and losing Mum, I returned to music with a purpose. I'm Still Here is not a search for fame. It is for anyone who needs a song to say what they cannot yet say. This is independent, heart-first art. You are not alone here."]]]]],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:290:8","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"absolute bottom-24 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 pointer-events-none","style":"opacity: 0;"},["SPAN",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:295:10","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-body text-[9px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase text-muted-foreground"},"Scroll"],["SPAN",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:296:10","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"block w-px h-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/70 to-transparent"}]]],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/MarqueeBar.jsx:32:4","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"relative w-full overflow-hidden border-y border-primary/25","style":"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1), rgba(245, 208, 110, 0.05), rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1));"},["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/MarqueeBar.jsx:35:6","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"flex py-3","style":"transform: none;"},["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/MarqueeBar.jsx:19:4","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"flex items-center shrink-0","aria-hidden":"false"},["SPAN",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/MarqueeBar.jsx:22:10","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"font-body text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-foreground/80 whitespace-nowrap","data-arr-index":"0","data-arr-variable-name":"ITEMS"},"Independent, heart-first music from Gannon Waye"],["SPAN",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/Marque