ready"],["SPAN",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/MarqueeBar.jsx:14:2","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"mx-6 text-primary/70 text-[10px]","aria-hidden":"true"},"◆"],["SPAN",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/MarqueeBar.jsx:22:10","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"font-body text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-foreground/80 whitespace-nowrap","data-arr-index":"4","data-arr-variable-name":"ITEMS"},"Join the community and follow the story"],["SPAN",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/MarqueeBar.jsx:14:2","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"mx-6 text-primary/70 text-[10px]","aria-hidden":"true"},"◆"]]],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/MarqueeBar.jsx:44:6","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-background to-transparent"}],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/MarqueeBar.jsx:45:6","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-16 bg-gradient-to-l from-background to-transparent"}]],["SECTION",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:304:6","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"py-10 md:py-14 px-4 md:px-6 relative"},["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:305:8","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"max-w-6xl mx-auto"},["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:306:10","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"text-center mb-10","style":"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"},["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:313:12","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-body text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase gradient-gold-glow mb-4"},"About"],["H2",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:314:12","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-body text-3xl md:text-5xl gradient-gold-text text-[hsl(var(--foreground))]"},"The Story"]],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:318:10","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"hidden md:grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr] gap-4 items-start"},["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:320:12","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"font-body text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed text-sm text-left space-y-4 pt-8","style":"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-16px);"},["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:327:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"I was born and raised in Adelaide and now call Melbourne home. We did not have the money for formal music lessons, no matter how often I asked, cried or begged, but that never weakened the drive. I learned by taking every chance available: leading school choirs, singing in church and eventually serving as a worship minister."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:328:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"I think deeply, feel deeply, and notice what others often miss. I'm obsessed with travel and culture. I care about people's wellbeing, sometimes more than they even realise about themselves. That perspective finds its way into everything I write."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:329:14","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"italic text-sm"},"I've been misunderstood and mislabelled more times than I can count. But I've learned that being misunderstood doesn't mean you're wrong. It often means you're seeing something others aren't ready for yet."]],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:333:12","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"w-52 flex flex-col items-center gap-1","style":"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"},["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:340:14","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"w-0.5 h-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-primary to-primary/30"}],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:341:14","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-display text-base gradient-gold-glow leading-7 italic text-center space-y-0"},["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:342:16","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"I didn't truly love myself"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:343:16","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"until I was 33."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:344:16","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"Before that, I woke up"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:345:16","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"every day wishing"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:346:16","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"I could be someone else."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:347:16","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"That fear of abandonment"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:348:16","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"ran my life."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:349:16","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"Then something shifted"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:350:16","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"and for the first time,"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:351:16","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"I didn't want to be"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:352:16","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"anyone else."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:353:16","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"mt-2 text-primary/50 not-italic tracking-widest uppercase text-[9px]"},"Gannon Waye"]],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:355:14","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"w-0.5 h-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/30 to-primary"}]],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:359:12","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"font-body text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed text-sm text-right space-y-4 pt-8","style":"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(16px);"},["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:366:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"My journey has not been simple. Childhood was shaped by family violence, an abusive father and a mother who struggled to regulate overwhelming emotion. In adulthood I survived abusive relationships, coercive control, addiction, PTSD and the loss of Mum. Each time life knocked me down, music gave me a way to stand again."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:367:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"The stages kept coming: I twice reached the grand final of Adelaide's Search for a Star, reached the Top 100 of Australian Idol, performed as a drag artist and opened Feast Festival in 2012. But the purpose is not trophies or fame. It is finding the voice I was denied and using it to reach someone else."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:368:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"I'm Still Here brings that purpose together. It is for the person searching for a song that can say what they cannot yet say, and for anyone who needs proof that being knocked down is not the end of the story."]]],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:373:10","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"md:hidden space-y-6"},["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:374:12","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-body text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed text-sm text-center"},"I was born and raised in Adelaide and now call Melbourne home. We did not have the money for formal music lessons, no matter how often I asked, cried or begged, but that never weakened the drive. I learned by taking every chance available: leading school choirs, singing in church and eventually serving as a worship minister."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:377:12","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-body text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed text-sm text-center"},"I think deeply, feel deeply, and notice what others often miss. I'm obsessed with travel and culture. I care about people's wellbeing, sometimes more than they even realise about themselves. That perspective finds its way into everything I write."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:380:12","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-body text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed text-sm text-center italic"},"I've been misunderstood and mislabelled more times than I can count. But I've learned that being misunderstood doesn't mean you're wrong. It often means you're seeing something others aren't ready for yet."],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:383:12","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"border-l-2 border-primary pl-4 font-display text-sm gradient-gold-glow italic leading-7"},["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:384:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"I didn't truly love myself"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:385:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"until I was 33."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:386:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"Before that, I woke up"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:387:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"every day wishing"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:388:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"I could be someone else."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:389:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"That fear of abandonment"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:390:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"ran my life."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:391:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"Then something shifted"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:392:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"and for the first time,"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:393:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"I didn't want to be"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:394:14","data-dynamic-content":"false"},"anyone else."]],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:396:12","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-body text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed text-sm text-center"},"My journey has not been simple. Childhood was shaped by family violence, an abusive father and a mother who struggled to regulate overwhelming emotion. In adulthood I survived abusive relationships, coercive control, addiction, PTSD and the loss of Mum. Each time life knocked me down, music gave me a way to stand again."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:399:12","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-body text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed text-sm text-center"},"The stages kept coming: I twice reached the grand final of Adelaide's Search for a Star, reached the Top 100 of Australian Idol, performed as a drag artist and opened Feast Festival in 2012. But the purpose is not trophies or fame. It is finding the voice I was denied and using it to reach someone else."],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:402:12","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-body text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed text-sm text-center"},"I'm Still Here brings that purpose together. It is for the person searching for a song that can say what they cannot yet say, and for anyone who needs proof that being knocked down is not the end of the story."]],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/pages/Home.jsx:407:10","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"mt-12 flex justify-center","style":"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"}]]],["SECTION",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:33:4","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"py-12 md:py-16 px-4 md:px-6 relative"},["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:34:6","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"max-w-6xl mx-auto"},["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:35:8","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"text-center mb-10","style":"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"},["P",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:41:10","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-body text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase gradient-gold-glow mb-4"},"For Press"],["H2",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:42:10","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-body text-3xl md:text-5xl gradient-gold-text"},"Digital Press Kit"]],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:45:8","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-primary/30","style":"background: radial-gradient(circle at 18% 20%, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.18), transparent 32%), radial-gradient(circle at 84% 80%, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.13), transparent 30%), radial-gradient(circle at 50% 52%, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.06), transparent 46%), linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(12, 12, 18) 0%, rgb(10, 10, 15) 50%, rgb(12, 12, 18) 100%);"},["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:52:10","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none","style":"background: linear-gradient(rgba(8, 8, 14, 0.28) 0%, rgba(8, 8, 14, 0.04) 42%, rgba(8, 8, 14, 0.28) 100%);"}],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:53:10","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"relative z-10 h-px w-full","style":"background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.7), transparent);"}],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:55:10","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"relative z-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-0"},["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:57:12","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"p-8 md:p-10"},["P",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:58:14","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-body text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase gradient-gold-text mb-3"},"Mission"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:59:14","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"font-body text-sm md:text-base text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed italic mb-6","data-collection-item-field":"MISSION"},"To reach people who need a voice or a song for what they cannot yet say through independent, emotionally honest music and storytelling."],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:61:14","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"h-px bg-border/50 mb-6"}],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:63:14","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"font-body text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase gradient-gold-text mb-3"},"Biography"],["P",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:64:14","data-dynamic-content":"true","class":"font-body text-sm text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed","data-collection-item-field":"BIO"},"Gannon Waye is an Adelaide-born, Melbourne-based independent singer songwriter. Raised without access to formal music lessons, he built his voice through school choirs, church, worship ministry, drag performance and community stages. His contemporary pop work transforms grief, family violence, abusive relationships, addiction, PTSD and rebuilding into honest music for people who need to feel less alone."],["DIV",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:66:14","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-8"},["A",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:67:16","data-dynamic-content":"false","href":"/press-kit"},["BUTTON",{"data-source-location":"src/components/public/PressKitHomeSection.jsx:68:18","data-dynamic-content":"false","class":"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&_svg]:pointer-events-none [&_svg]:size-4 [&_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow hover:bg-primary/90 h-9 gap-2 rounded-full gradient-gold-button border-0 px-6 py-3 text-xs tracking-wider uppercase font-body"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":